      "comment": "Hroptatyr: Eftirvit (Pierro)",
      "content": "Eftirvit is the name Pierro bore as a Khaenri'ahn scholar. He and Hroptatyr studied together under Mimameith and enjoyed a friendly rivalry in their field. Hroptatyr became President and Eftirvit Vice-President; Rhinedottir says Eftirvit made no secret of his envy. Hroptatyr thanks him for sharp questions in the seminars under the tree.",
