      "key": [
        "Mimameith",
        "the professor"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Hroptatyr",
        "The Wise",
        "Universitas"
      ],
      "comment": "Hroptatyr: Professor Mimameith",
      "content": "Mimameith was the teacher of Hroptatyr and Eftirvit. She took part in the Vinster King's Abyss project, and her health never recovered. Hroptatyr, treating her as family, sought a cure through Crimson Moon research. The wiki records no other details; no profile exists for her.",
