    "4": {
      "uid": 4,
      "key": [
        "rescue Vedrfolnir",
        "storm the palace",
        "Vedrfolnir's imprisonment"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Hroptatyr",
        "The Wise"
      ],
      "comment": "Hroptatyr: The Meeting to Save Vedrfolnir",
      "content": "When the king blinded and imprisoned Vedrfolnir, Dainsleif gathered Hroptatyr, Rhinedottir, Surtalogi and Rerir to plan a rescue. Hroptatyr objected that it was too dangerous and reminded Dainsleif of his oath, but joined; he and Rhinedottir were to disable the palace's defences while Rerir went to the prison.",
