    "5": {
      "uid": 5,
      "key": [
        "Five Sinners",
        "Sinners of Khaenri'ah"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Hroptatyr",
        "The Wise"
      ],
      "comment": "Hroptatyr: The Five Sinners",
      "content": "Dainsleif names the Five Sinners: \"The Wise\" Hroptatyr, \"The Visionary\" Vedrfolnir, \"Gold\" Rhinedottir, \"The Foul\" Surtalogi and \"Rächer of Solnari\" Rerir. They could not resist the call of the Abyss and divided among themselves a power that could destroy the world; when the cataclysm came, not one of them defended their nation.",
