        "Ardent Storm"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Hroptatyr: Starkuthr (Ardent Storm)",
      "content": "The Ardent Storm weapon appearance describes an illusory claymore from the Ley Lines which \"once held the name Starkuthr\" when wielded by a wise sinner in an ancient land. The wiki ties it to Hroptatyr and the power of Reason. It is a weapon appearance obtained for a limited time from the Stygian Onslaught event, and no scene shows him using it.",
